.TH "MEMSTAT" "1" "Mar 07, 2026" "1.1" "libmemcached-awesome"
.SH "نام (NAME)"
memstat \- libmemcached Documentation
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.sp
memstat [options] [stat args]
.sp
Gather statistics from a server
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.sp
\fBmemstat\fP  dumps the state of \fBmemcached(1) \%<https://\:linux\:.die\:.net/\:man/\:1/\:memcached>\fP servers.
It prints all data to stdout.
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-h|\-\-help
Display help.
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-V|\-\-version
Display version.
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-q|\-\-quiet
Operate quietly.
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-v|\-\-verbose
Operate more verbosely.
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-d|\-\-debug
See \fB\-v|\-\-verbose\fP\&.
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-s|\-\-servers <list of servers>
Specify the list of servers as \fIhostname[:port][,hostname[:port]...]\fP\&.
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-n|\-\-non\-blocking
Enable non\-blocking operations.
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-N|\-\-tcp\-nodelay
Disable Nagle\(aqs algorithm.
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-b|\-\-binary
Enable binary protocol.
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-B|\-\-buffer
Buffer requests.
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-u|\-\-username <username>
Use \fIusername\fP for SASL authentication.
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-p|\-\-password <password>
Use \fIpassword\fP for SASL authentication.
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-A|\-\-args <stat>
Stat args.
.sp
\fBDEPRECATED:\fP use positional arguments.
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-a|\-\-analyze [<arg>]
Analyze and print differences of a server cluster.
A memory and uptime comparison is performed by default.
.sp
Options:
.INDENT 7.0
.TP
.B \-\-analyze[=default]
Memory and uptime comparison.
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 7.0
.TP
.BI \-\-analyze\fB= latency
Network latency comparison.
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-S|\-server\-version
Obtain and print server version(s) only.
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-\-iterations
Iteration count of GETs sent by the latency test (default: 1000).
.UNINDENT
.SH "محیط (ENVIRONMENT)"
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B MEMCACHED_SERVERS
Specify a list of servers.
.UNINDENT
.SH "نکات (NOTES)"
.SS PROGRAM PREFIX
.sp
The prefix of this program is variable, i.e. it can be configured at build time.
.sp
Usually the client programs of \fBlibmemcached\-awesome\fP are prefixed with \fBmem\fP, like \fBmemcat\fP or \fBmemcp\fP\&.
.sp
It can be configured, though, to replace the prefix with something else like \fBmc\fP, in case of that,
the client programs of \fBlibmemcached\-awesome\fP would be called \fBmccat\fP, \fBmccp\fP, etc. respectively.
.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
.sp
\fBmemcached(1) \%<https://\:linux\:.die\:.net/\:man/\:1/\:memcached>\fP
\fBlibmemcached(3) \%<https://\:linux\:.die\:.net/\:man/\:3/\:libmemcached>\fP
.INDENT 0.0
.IP \(bu 2
C/C++ Client Library for memcached \%<>
.IP \(bu 2
